sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant LP as LoginPage
    participant AS as AuthService
    participant MW as Middleware
    participant BE as 后端API
    participant DB as Dashboard

    U->>LP: 输入用户名/密码 + 勾选 Remember Me
    LP->>LP: 表单验证
    LP->>AS: login(username, password, tenantCode)
    AS->>BE: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    BE-->>AS: Set-Cookie(HttpOnly access+refresh) + {user, tenant}
    AS->>AS: useAuthStore.login(user, tenant)
    AS-->>LP: true (登录成功)
    LP->>LP: router.push('/dashboard')
    
    Note over MW: 中间件只检查会话 cookie 是否存在
    
    MW->>MW: access cookie present?
    alt Cookie 存在
        MW-->>DB: NextResponse.next()
        DB->>BE: GET /api/v1/auth/me (credentials include)
        BE-->>DB: 已验证的用户/tenant上下文
        DB->>DB: 加载仪表盘数据
        alt 数据为空
            DB->>U: 显示空状态引导卡片
        else 数据存在
            DB->>U: 显示仪表盘内容
        end
    else Cookie 缺失或 /auth/me 拒绝
        MW->>MW: redirect('/login')
        LP->>U: 显示登录页
    end
